@page "/services"

<PageTitle>Cleaning Services | Tidy but Mighty Cleaning Service — Cleveland, TN</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Explore residential, commercial, deep cleaning, and move-in/move-out cleaning services from Tidy but Mighty Cleaning Service in Cleveland, TN and surrounding areas." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://tidybutmightycleaning.com/services" />
</HeadContent>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow">Our Services</span>
        <h1>Residential &amp; Commercial Cleaning Services</h1>
        <p>
            With 15+ years of experience, Tidy but Mighty delivers thorough, dependable cleaning tailored to your property, schedule, and budget.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container grid-2">
        <article class="card">
            <img src="images/hero-living-room.jpg" alt="Residential house cleaning" class="card-photo" />
            <span class="card-tag">Weekly &bull; Bi-Weekly &bull; Monthly</span>
            <h2 class="card-title">Recurring Residential Cleaning</h2>
            <p class="card-body">
                Keep your home consistently fresh without sacrificing your weekends. Choose weekly, bi-weekly, or monthly visits customized to your priorities.
            </p>
            <ul class="checklist">
                <li>Kitchen countertops, sinks, stovetops &amp; exterior appliances</li>
                <li>Full bathroom sanitization (tubs, showers, toilets, vanities, mirrors)</li>
                <li>Bedroom &amp; living area dusting, vacuuming, and floor mopping</li>
                <li>Trash removal and high-touch surface wipe-downs</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
            <img src="images/deep-clean-kitchen.jpg" alt="Deep clean kitchen detailing" class="card-photo" />
            <span class="card-tag">Intensive Detail</span>
            <h2 class="card-title">Deep Cleaning</h2>
            <p class="card-body">
                A top-to-bottom reset that tackles built-up dust, grease, and grime in the places routine cleaning often misses. Great as a first visit or seasonal refresh.
            </p>
            <ul class="checklist">
                <li>Baseboards, door frames, window sills &amp; trim wiped clean</li>
                <li>Ceiling fans, vents &amp; light fixtures dusted</li>
                <li>Cabinet fronts, backsplash &amp; fixture detailing</li>
                <li>Extra attention to grout, corners, and under furniture</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
            <span class="card-tag">Turnkey Transitions</span>
            <h2 class="card-title">Move-In &amp; Move-Out Cleaning</h2>
            <p class="card-body">
                Moving is stressful enough. Let us handle the heavy scrubbing so landlords, buyers, or your family step into an immaculate home.
            </p>
            <ul class="checklist">
                <li>Empty cabinets, drawers &amp; closets wiped inside and out</li>
                <li>Full kitchen &amp; bathroom deep sanitization</li>
                <li>Interior window sills, baseboards &amp; floor restoration</li>
                <li>Fast turnaround for realtors, landlords &amp; homeowners</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
            <img src="images/commercial-office.jpg" alt="Commercial and office cleaning" class="card-photo" />
            <span class="card-tag">Offices &amp; Small Businesses</span>
            <h2 class="card-title">Commercial Cleaning</h2>
            <p class="card-body">
                A clean workplace boosts morale and leaves a lasting impression on customers. Reliable, trustworthy service for offices, studios, and storefronts.
            </p>
            <ul class="checklist">
                <li>Reception areas, conference rooms &amp; desks</li>
                <li>Breakrooms, kitchenettes &amp; restroom sanitization</li>
                <li>Floor care (vacuuming, sweeping &amp; mopping)</li>
                <li>One-time or recurring schedules</li>
            </ul>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-band">
            <div>
                <h2>Need a custom cleaning checklist?</h2>
                <p>Tell us about your home or business and we&rsquo;ll put together an honest, affordable estimate.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem;">
                <NavLink href="/quote" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</NavLink>
                <a href="tel:+14233311730" class="btn btn-secondary">Call (423) 331-1730</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
